Third-party code
----------------

Files ported from other projects keep their original copyright header,
followed by a "Modified by Pie Launcher" line. Each source is listed below
when its first file is ported.

Allowed sources: Apache-2.0 (or more permissive) code only, for example
AOSP and Lawnchair. GPL-licensed launchers such as Kvaesitso may be read
for ideas and behaviour, but their code must not be copied or closely
paraphrased.

